import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 791 | Transcended Ones and Ethics · Overview — The Transcended One's Ethical System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 791 | Transcended Ones and Ethics · Overview — The Transcended One's Ethical System","no":791,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Ethics","Overview","Non-Interference","Causal Self-Discipline"],"related":["19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","88-Cross-Plane Ethics Code","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0791_模块4-伦理-总论.md","filePath":"en/0791_模块4-伦理-总论.md"}`),r={name:"en/0791_模块4-伦理-总论.md"};function s(o,e,l,h,c,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-791-transcended-ones-and-ethics-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-ethical-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 791 | Transcended Ones and Ethics · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Ethical System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-791-transcended-ones-and-ethics-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-ethical-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 791 | Transcended Ones and Ethics · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Ethical System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 19, 88, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-is-the-strongest-one-s-ethics-stricter-than-ordinary-people-s" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why is the strongest one&#39;s ethics stricter than ordinary people&#39;s? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-is-the-strongest-one-s-ethics-stricter-than-ordinary-people-s" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why is the strongest one&#39;s ethics stricter than ordinary people&#39;s?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s strong ones have no ethical constraints — he is strongest, what he does is right. Heng Yuan Zhou must squarely answer: <strong>one person strong enough for the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm — should his ethical standards be higher or lower than ordinary people&#39;s?</strong> The answer: higher. Not because his character is better, but because his destructive power is larger. This entry, as this group&#39;s overview, must lay out the transcended-one ethical system&#39;s overall framework.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom is the ethical system&#39;s bottom line; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the ethical system&#39;s source; the collective ascension axiom is the ethical system&#39;s direction; the causal self-discipline axiom is the ethical system&#39;s operational norm; the law-first axiom requires the ethical system itself be self-consistent, executable, and not rewritable by any transcended individual.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-strong-s-ethics-must-be-stricter" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Strong&#39;s Ethics Must Be Stricter <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-strong-s-ethics-must-be-stricter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Strong&#39;s Ethics Must Be Stricter&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world believes &quot;the strong are free&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s logic is the exact opposite:</p><ul><li><strong>The greater the destructive power, the greater the mistake cost</strong>: an ordinary person&#39;s mistake ruins a room; the transcended one&#39;s mistake ruins a star sector. Cost is proportional to destructive power, and ethical standards must be proportional too;</li><li><strong>The more gazed up at, the easier to self-deify</strong>: the transcended one, gazed up at by Myriad Ranks for long, easily feels &quot;whatever I do is right.&quot; The ethical system is the external brake on this self-hallucination;</li><li><strong>The greater the ability, the greater the temptation</strong>: the transcended one can do so much — rewrite history, adjust causality, rearrange rules. The greater the temptation, the more ethical red lines are needed.</li></ul><p>Three reasons together: <strong>it is not that the transcended one&#39;s character is bad, but that the transcended one&#39;s post risk is too large.</strong> Risk large, ethical standards must be high.</p><h2 id="ii-the-transcended-one-ethical-system-s-four-pillars" tabindex="-1">II. The Transcended-One Ethical System&#39;s Four Pillars <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-transcended-one-ethical-system-s-four-pillars" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Transcended-One Ethical System&#39;s Four Pillars&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s transcended-one ethical system has four pillars:</p><ol><li><strong>Non-interference principle</strong> (entry 792): the transcended one by default does not interfere with Myriad Ranks&#39; natural development;</li><li><strong>Limited-interference boundary</strong> (entry 793): when Myriad Ranks actively request or disaster is urgent, limited interference is allowed, but with strict boundaries;</li><li><strong>Causal self-discipline practice</strong> (entry 794): all cross-plane, cross-time operations are strictly reported; observe-first-then-interfere; only backflow knowledge, do not disturb causality;</li><li><strong>Attachment-and-rascal prevention</strong> (entries 795, 796): prevent the transcended one himself from being eroded by &quot;all-beings&#39; origin attachment · shortcut inner demon,&quot; and prevent him from becoming a &quot;justified rascal.&quot;</li></ol><p>Four pillars together form a complete ethical system of &quot;non-interference primary, limited-interference auxiliary, causal self-discipline throughout, inner defense as backstop.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-ethical-system-and-civilizational-weight-s-relationship" tabindex="-1">III. The Ethical System and Civilizational Weight&#39;s Relationship <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-ethical-system-and-civilizational-weight-s-relationship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Ethical System and Civilizational Weight&#39;s Relationship&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The ethical system is not an abstract moral requirement; it hooks directly into entry 706&#39;s civilizational-weight formula:</p><ul><li>Violating non-interference principle → procedure-compliance subitem deducted;</li><li>Overstepping limited-interference boundary → direction-correctness subitem deducted;</li><li>Missing causal report → procedure-compliance subitem directly zeroed;</li><li>Attachment or rascal behavior → origin-legality subitem deducted; in severe cases directly negative.</li></ul><p>Ethical deductions directly cause civilizational-weight decline; weight decline causes law-anchoring permissions to downgrade. This is what &quot;ethics is not a slogan, but a ledger&quot; means.</p><h2 id="iv-five-sub-articles-positioning-preview" tabindex="-1">IV. Five Sub-Articles&#39; Positioning Preview <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-five-sub-articles-positioning-preview" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Five Sub-Articles&#39; Positioning Preview&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entries 792–796, five sub-articles, will handle the four pillars&#39; concrete operations one by one:</p><ul><li><strong>Non-interference principle</strong> (792): the jurisprudential basis and operational boundary of default non-interference;</li><li><strong>Limited-interference boundary</strong> (793): when may one interfere? To what extent?</li><li><strong>Causal self-discipline practice</strong> (794): concrete reporting procedure for cross-plane operations;</li><li><strong>All-beings&#39; Origin Attachment Prevention</strong> (795): how the transcended one himself is not eroded by the shortcut inner demon;</li><li><strong>Justified Rascal Cultivation</strong> (796): how to prevent the transcended one from becoming an &quot;in-the-name-of-love&quot; predator.</li></ul><p>Why must ethical standards rise with power? The reason is simple: an ordinary person&#39;s one greedy thought takes at most one extra bite of food; a transcended one&#39;s one greedy thought may move an entire plane&#39;s spiritual vein for private use. Ethical constraint intensity must be proportional to destructive power. Therefore Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ethical system is not &quot;equal to everyone&quot; — ordinary people only need to obey bottom-line law; the transcended one must additionally carry four layers of obligation above the bottom line: active reporting, active recusal, active stepping down, active stepping up. These four layers of obligation are not moral kidnapping, but a post contract: you took the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s authority, and automatically signed accepting these four layers of constraints. Whoever does not want constraints may at any time downgrade and retire, returning to the ranks of ordinary cultivators; no one stops him.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the ethical system prevents the transcended one from using computable power to do things that disturb Myriad Ranks&#39; causality; it is the computable-power &quot;steering wheel&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the non-interference principle from its root seals &quot;I did it for your own good so I decide for you&quot; this advanced predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system the transcended one has no ethical constraints; Heng Yuan Zhou uses four pillars to raise ethical standards to the highest</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the ethical system applies equally to all Myriad-Rank beings; the transcended one may not be an exception</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the ethical system&#39;s entire rules, cases, and audit records are opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. Ethical execution is recorded throughout by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The strongest one&#39;s ethics must be stricter than ordinary people&#39;s. Not because his character is bad, but because his destructive power is large, temptation is large, and he easily self-deifies. Four pillars together form an ethical net of &quot;do not strike casually, striking has boundaries, striking must be reported, inner mind has defense.&quot; No matter how strong the transcended one, he is in this net.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/19-修炼伦理与边界.html">Entry 19 · Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/88-跨位面伦理准则.html">Entry 88 · Cross-Plane Ethics Code</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=t(r,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
